Game asset for a 2D animation rig, matching the eyes of this fox character Charlie (3D clay cartoon style).
Draw ONLY the white of one eye (the eyeball without any iris or pupil), seen straight on: a slightly tall oval filling about 90% of the canvas, centered.
Soft glossy porcelain white, gently shaded: a warm soft grey-beige shadow along the top inner edge (as if cast by the eyelid) and a faint shadow around the rim, brightest just below the centre.
No iris, no pupil, no eyelids, no lashes, no skin, no outline. Fully transparent background.
